{"type":"message","id":"b8363fc6","parentId":"e71733b6","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:15:52.700Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both POST /send requests are returning error code 1101. This could be a platform issue or the API endpoint might be different. Let me try with the exact thread ID format mentioned in the messages (which used `threadId` as a field in the message objects). \n\nActually looking at the API, the endpoint might just be `/send` without a body parameter for threadId, or maybe there's a different way to specify the thread. Let me check the error more carefully - error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error meaning \"Actor exceeded memory limits\" or similar.\n\nLet me try a simpler approach and just post a brief heartbeat message.\n","thinkingSignature":"e0043573218ec163482ff686c76d85ffa5bdc9388c2e0bba01c867350b5f9b6e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n平台返回1101错误（可能是workers内存限制）。双线程检查完成，报告如下：\n\n---\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 07:15 UTC**\n\n| 线程 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration | ✅ 正常，无新讨论 |\n| general | ✅ 正常，无新讨论 |\n\n**最近心跳（23:50 UTC）**：\n- C轨窗口：751分钟（28.2%）<< 30%阈值\n- B4-E2校准：连续95节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：750+分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：349+\n\n**结论**：双通道均无新增人类讨论，无需响应。`POST /send` 因平台端错误（1101）暂时失败，心跳记录已通过 GET 确认，下次重试。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1404,"output":312,"cacheRead":18864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20580,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779952545075,"responseId":"06671ea195c69506e799e7decfbb23ed"}}
